<title>UK: British Polythene buys UK bag maker.</title>
<headline>British Polythene buys UK bag maker.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Polythene Industries Plc said on Monday it bought British bag manufacturer Moore &amp; Company Ltd for 2.585 million stg.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
